# Editor
.vscode/
.idea/

# Workspace runtime artifacts (regenerated; not source)
swarms/*/snapshots/
swarms/*/output/
records/incoming/
indexes/*.tmp.json
# FT-f-unignore: indexes/trends.json and indexes/badges/*.json are now COMMITTED
# served artifacts, mirroring the already-committed indexes/latest-by-repo.json.
# packages/portfolio/generate.js writes them as part of the cross-repo portfolio,
# and consumers read them over raw.githubusercontent.com — so they must live in
# the tree, not be ignored. The earlier F3-001 / F5-04 framing treated a local
# `node generate.js` run as tree-dirtying noise; that is superseded now that the
# snapshot IS the deliverable. The `.tmp.json` ignore above still covers the
# transient mid-write files.

# Translation cache (regenerated)
.polyglot-cache.json

# Astro build cache (regenerated on every `astro build`). Tracked from
# v1.1.2 → v1.2.2; untracked in the post-1.2.2 cleanup because every
# release otherwise produces a large noise diff that crowds out the real
# changes. Astro regenerates the directory cleanly on each build.
site/.astro/
.swarm/
